# Fungus1_01b from the east (x 44.5) to the west gate into Fungus1_02.
# Planned with hk-walkplan room on the disc (HK_WALKPLAN_MARGIN=0.4, sync poll), with the whole run from the Ancestral Mound before it as the pre fragment
# (so the masks, SOUL and Geo are the chain's own), 2026-11-03. The exit is waited for by the next room's arrival.
at 44.50 6.40
walk 42.01
walk 42.44   # run-up
walk 42.01   # take-off
hold left+cross for 12
hold left for 20
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
fight 4 0.32 44.69
snipe
guard 2
retreat 0.32 44.69
heal
walk 38.01   # run-up
walk 37.58   # take-off
hold left+cross for 12
hold left for 19
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
